# Stellar Miles Loyalty & Rewards

Every credit you spend on shipping earns Stellar Miles. Miles lift your membership tier and pay for upgrades on later shipments.

---

## Loyalty Tiers

{% card-grid %}
{% card title="Bronze Tier" icon="star" %}
- Entry level on sign-up
- Earn **10 Stellar Miles per 100 credits** shipped
- 10% off all shipments
{% /card %}

{% card title="Silver Tier" icon="rocket" %}
- Reach at 50,000 lifetime miles
- Earn **12.5 Stellar Miles per 100 credits** (1.25x multiplier)
- Free insurance up to 1M credits and access to express lanes
{% /card %}

{% card title="Gold Tier" icon="heart" %}
- Reach at 150,000 lifetime miles
- Earn **15 Stellar Miles per 100 credits** (1.5x multiplier)
- A dedicated account manager and real-time cargo monitoring
{% /card %}
{% /card-grid %}

The full list of perks is on [Member Benefits](/docs/member-benefits).

---

## Redeeming Rewards

Spend miles to move a shipment up the queue: a priority upgrade costs 2,000 miles and is charged when you change the shipment's priority.

{% callout type="tip" title="Double Miles on Warp Days" %}
Every shipment booked with `express-warp` delivery on the first day of a galactic quarter earns double Stellar Miles.
{% /callout %}

Try a priority upgrade in the sandbox:

{% api-operation spec="shipments" path="/shipments/{shipmentId}/priority" method="put" /%}
